 ）。请注意：您将在一两周内收到Edsby消息，告知您的储
 物柜号码和密码。请勿到办公室询问，请等待Edsby消息。
 \n\n公告原文：\nDO YOU WANT A LOCKER?\nIf you would like a locker\, p
 lease fill out the PTC Locker Request Form. The link is attached below (st
 udents have access). PLEASE NOTE: YOU WILL GET AN EDSBY MESSAGE WITH YOUR 
